# Replay-only virtual compass heading, preserving EKF3 and IMU integration.
# Physical coefficients are unchanged. The JSON backend synthesizes magnetic
# field from AP_Declination at virtual home 33.810313, -118.393867 [deg].
# GPS is disabled, so provide the same table's declination explicitly [rad].
# No per-bag yaw offset fitting or truth-mode AHRS is used.
COMPASS_ENABLE 1
COMPASS_USE 1
COMPASS_USE2 0
COMPASS_USE3 0
EK3_SRC1_YAW 1
COMPASS_AUTODEC 0
COMPASS_DEC 0.20478525084
